ea:\n\nPeace be upon you. The world suffers from disasters like floods and torrential rains. If a model of the world were created to identify flood-prone areas, and people living in flood-prone areas were relocated to safe places, away from the floods and torrential rains, to prevent loss of life, and ideally, farms and fields were moved to safer locations if possible to avoid crop damage, and if there were a way to construct large pipelines to drain floodwater into seas or safe areas, the question arises: they are poor, so how can we do something like this for them? I have an idea: if the following idea were implemented, it would be possible If this were implemented by an entity in Dubai that undertakes such an investment, we could potentially secure the necessary funds not only for flood and torrential rain relief but also for providing free healthcare, free education, free humanitarian aid, and other basic necessities to people worldwide. We could also build desalination plants for coastal nations and extend international water pipelines, protected by governments to prevent tampering and sabotage. Where people live in arid deserts and arid lands, we could provide free healthcare, free education, and free housing if they don\'t want to migrate to cities.\n\nI can illustrate all of this using a globe or model. Don\'t forget the key to the globe or model.\n\nThe third idea concerns the climate crisis and global warming.\n\nThis idea about the climate crisis and global warming, if it falls within your area of ​​expertise, is related to the writings on the climate crisis and global warming.\n\nPeace be upon you. Is it possible to save marine life that is dying due to the climate crisis, global warming, forest burning, and the displacement of wildlife? Perhaps these are writings about an invention that contributes to saving the marine and terrestrial environment. Note: I do not speak English well. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of this invention\n\nNote: I do not like to appear on social media or media, considering these writings from a benefactor. The writings concerned with this invention are\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you, I do not speak English fluently. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of these writings. Note: I am giving up these writings to a person who is competent to move forward in order to achieve his goal. These are writings that can serve the climate crisis and the rise in the temperature of the Earth. I did not request any certificate of honor or any honor. The person who moves forward with these writings deserves all respect and appreciation in front of the world. Note: I do not speak English fluently and I do not appear in\n\nSocial media and media do not consider these writings to be from a benefactor. The writings in question are:\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you. Any party can adopt such writings that serve the climate crisis and global warming. Note: I do not speak English well. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of these writings. Note: I do not like to appear on social media or media. Consider these writings from a benefactor. The writings in question are\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you, I don\'t speak English well. Can these writings be transferred to a section that specializes in such writings? Note: I do not like to appear on social media or the media. Consider that these are writings from a benefactor. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to understand the content of these writings. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. The writings in question are:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you, I do not speak English fluently. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. You can seek help from someone 