herefore, I can explain on a piece of paper if I am asked to do so. I only need it. A pen, a ruler, and a piece of paper to explain, but without knowing anyone who suggested this idea, if it is useful, many thanks and gratitude to you. A material can be put in place that prevents fires from going through\nOn this barren land, I can explain it all on a piece of paper\n\n\n___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\nPeace be upon you. The idea is to invest one trillion dirhams per country from its budget, which can be calculated in local currency. This money would be invested in global stocks and commodities under the supervision of each country individually to prevent theft or corruption. The funds would then be used to provide free healthcare, free education, and some free humanitarian aid, which could be identified through cooperation and addressing humanitarian problems. The money previously allocated to education and healthcare would then be used for other purposes.\n\nIt involves some family outings and travel, and perhaps if a solar-powered car were invented, no one would walk long distances. As an official body, you can assess the potential success of this idea. Thank you very much.', 'ar'),
