ارتفاع درجة حرارة الارض إذا تدخل ضمن أحتصاصكم الكتابات المعنية بأزمة المناخ والارتفاع درجة حرارة الارض هي \n\n\nPeace be upon you. Is it possible to save marine life that is dying due to the climate crisis, global warming, forest burning, and the displacement of wildlife? Perhaps these are writings about an invention that contributes to saving the marine and terrestrial environment. Note: I do not speak English well. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of this invention\n\nNote: I do not like to appear on social media or media, considering these writings from a benefactor. The writings concerned with this invention are\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you, I do not speak English fluently. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of these writings. Note: I am giving up these writings to a person who is competent to move forward in order to achieve his goal. These are writings that can serve the climate crisis and the rise in the temperature of the Earth. I did not request any certificate of honor or any honor. The person who moves forward with these writings deserves all respect and appreciation in front of the world. Note: I do not speak English fluently and I do not appear in\n\nSocial media and media do not consider these writings to be from a benefactor. The writings in question are:\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you. Any party can adopt such writings that serve the climate crisis and global warming. Note: I do not speak English well. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of these writings. Note: I do not like to appear on social media or media. Consider these writings from a benefactor. The writings in question are\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you, I do not speak English well. Can these writings be transferred to a section that specializes in such writings? Note: I do not like to appear on social media or the media. Consider that these are writings from a benefactor. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to understand the content of these writings. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. The writings in question are:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you, I do not speak English fluently. I use Google Translate to communicate with you. You can seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to understand the content of these writings. Note: I do not like to appear on social media or media. Consider that these are writings about climate and global warming. Consider that these are writings from a benefactor. The writings in question are:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWritings concerned with the climate crisis and global warming are:\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you. Please transfer these writings to your specialized department. This invention may contribute to solving the climate crisis and the rise in the Earth’s temperature, and this cannot be achieved without your help. The writings concerned with the climate crisis and the rise in the Earth’s temperature are:\n\nPeace be upon you. Note: I do not speak English well, nor do I appear on social media or the media. Consider these writings about an invention that may contribute to the climate crisis and the rise in the temperature of the Earth by a benefactor. The writings in question are:If a car is invented that runs on solar energy without petroleum, and petroleum-powered cars are converted into solar-powered cars, we must find a way to pconvert a car from petroleum to solar energy, even used car dealerships around the world, we convert them to solar energy so that they are not exposed to financial losses, as they are the owners, families, children, and a source of livelihood that canWe do not find a person walking around the world. Every person owns a car, and according to my expectations, its price will be cheap, so that every person owns a car that runs on solar energy and is cheap. It may be a little difficult, perhaps, how to charge a car itself in countries where there is a lot of snow. It may be difficult, according to my thinking, but with knowledge and science, it is not difficult.\n\n--------------------------------------\n\nThere is another way in which we find how we contribute to the climate crisis and the rise in the temperature of the Earth. Factories around the world have chimneys that we find perform the transformation of smoke into a liquid that we benefit from, and even the water used in the world’s factories, we do not dispose of it in rivers, but rather treat it and benefit from it by chemical methods.\nWe can appreciate and evaluate these writings by their effectiveness in serving the climate crisis and global warming.\n\n\ndo not ask for any honor or appreciation. A person who does these things by inventing them deserves all appreciation, respect, and honor. The Imam is a scholar. I can explain everything written. I just need a translator to translate the language to explain his idea. Thank you very much and I am grateful\nالسلام عليكم يوجد جهاز شفط دخان سواء داخل منازل في مطابخ أومطاعم لماذا لايتم إيجاد خاصية تحويل دخان طبخ سواء في المنزل أومطاعم تحويله للسائل والاحتفاظ به مكان غير مرئي لكي لايذهب بمتناول الأطفال وإذا أمكن أستفاده منه جهه تحوله إلى شيء مفيد هذا سائل وتخلص منه بطرق آمنه وعدم ألقاء سائل في تربة لكي لايكون مصدر تخريب للتربة أو أختلاط مع مياه جوفية ويلوثها ويمكنني شرح كل ذلك إذا طلب مني ذلك \nوالان مصانع على مستوى العالم \nالسلام عليكم هل يمكن تحويل دخان مصانع على مستوى العالم قبل خروج من فوهات الادخنةإلى سائل وفصل من سوائل إلى أشياء يمكن نستفيد منها وحتى مياه التي تستخدم في مصنع بدل رميها وتخلص منها مما تخرب الأرض أو تختلط مع مياه جوفيه نفصل محتوياتها ونستفيد منها بأغراض أخرى بهذا إذا أستطعنا فعل ذلك بهذا ساهمنا بعدم أرتفاع حرارة الأرض وازمة مناخ وندخل طاقة الشمسية بكل شيء بدل الكهرباء بحيث يكون متناسق لايعرف بأنها تعمل بالطاقة الشمسية بمعنى متناسق من داخل والخارج ولكم جزيل شكر والعرفان \n\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPeace be upon you. It is possible to have the idea of ​​stopping the world\'s forest fires, but I am not good at English, but I will send a translation from Arabic to English using Google Translate. You can also seek help from someone who knows Arabic and English fluently to know the content of this email. The email is\n\n\nالسلام عليكم يشهد العالم حرائق الغابات إذا هذه طريقة تنفع سيكون هناك بصيص الامل ونتجنب ماسيعانية العالم إذا لم نتحرك لاجل هذا شيء  الطريقة هي لماذا لايتم عمل فواصل بين الغالبات  بمعني الفاصل ارض جرداء لايوجد عليها زرع الاشجار على سبيل مثال للشرح فقط بين كل مساحة أربع كيلوا بالعرض واربع كيلوا بالطول بينهم فاصل أرض جرداء لايوجد عليها زرع وعند حدوث حرائق أرض جرداء لم تستطيع نيران تجاوزها بهذا حاصرنا نيران بدل مايكون هناك خسائر بالاقتصاد والاكسجين والاشخاص والاطفائيين أيضا من يعملون على اطفاء يمكن يدفعوا حياتهم ثمن لذلك يمكنني شرح على ورقة إذا طلب مني ذلك فقط محتاج قلم ومسطرة وورقة للشرح ولكن دون معرفة أحد من دل على هذه فكرة إذا تنفع ولكم جزيل شكر والعرفان ويمكن وضع مادة تمنع تجاوز الحرائق على هذه الارض جرداء يمكنني شرح كل ذلك على ورقة\nPeace be upon you. The world is witnessing forest fires. If this method works, there will be a glimmer of hope and we will avoid what the world will suffer if we do not take action for this thing. The method is: Why are no partitions made between the forests? In the sense of the partition, a barren land on which there is no tree plantation, as an example, just to explain, between each area, four kilometers in width. And four kilometers in length, between them there is a separator of barren land with no crops on it, and when fires occurred in barren land, fires could not pass over them. Thus, we were besieged by fires, instead of there being losses to the economy, oxygen, people, and also the firefighters. Those who work to extinguish may pay with their lives. Therefore, I can explain on a piece of paper if I am asked to do so. I only need it. A pen, a ruler, and a piece of paper to explain, but without knowing anyone who suggested this idea, if it is useful, many thanks and gratitude to you. A material can be put in place that prevents fires from going through\nOn this barren land, I can explain it all on a piece of paper\n\n\n___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\n\nPeace be upon you. The idea is to invest one trillion dirhams per country from its budget, which can be calculated in local currency. This money would be invested in global stocks and commodities under the supervision of each country individually to prevent theft or corruption. The funds would then be used to provide free healthcare, free education, and some free humanitarian aid, which could be identified through cooperation and addressing humanitarian problems. The money previously allocated to education and healthcare would then be used for other purposes.\n\nIt involves some family outings and travel, and perhaps if a solar-powered car were invented, no one would walk long distances. As an official body, you can assess the potential success of this idea. Thank you very much.', 'ar'),
